# Task: Ontology - Debug Session

**Priorities**

* **DEBUGGING**: 
    * If applicable, debug the current run of the [Test Pipeline](#view-test-pipeline) section.
    * If applicable, debug the current run of the [Test Sessions](#view-test-session) section.
    * If changes to the Codebase are required for debugging, implement the solution.
* **SIMULATION** Run through mental simulations of the Codebase to find [Bugs](#template-bug). Report the results.
* **COVERAGE** Add any unit tests for any areas of the code not already covered.
    * Ignore `app.core` tag coverage unless introducing changes to those specific areas, i.e. the Board, Engine and Screen are already sufficiently covered. 
* **BUGHUNTING** If new, unrelated bugs are detected, **do not implement the solution**. Instead, open a new [Bug Report](#template-bug) for **User Review**.


